WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.357
Here's the UV bulge.

00:00:01.984 --> 00:00:04.295
Step one, repair proteins find the damage.

00:00:05.142 --> 00:00:07.162
Step two, they cut the backbone on

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.010
both sides.

00:00:08.463 --> 00:00:10.204
Then they remove the damaged bases.

00:00:11.052 --> 00:00:13.478
Step three, new bases fill the gap.

00:00:14.105 --> 00:00:16.566
Step four, the backbone gets sealed shut.

00:00:17.286 --> 00:00:18.668
Like cutting out a bad patch and

00:00:18.737 --> 00:00:19.713
sewing in a new one.

00:00:20.107 --> 00:00:22.081
Repair enzymes cut out the damaged piece,

00:00:22.371 --> 00:00:24.148
fill in new bases, and reseal the

00:00:24.171 --> 00:00:24.658
backbone.

00:00:25.285 --> 00:00:26.481
Swipe for the recap.
